      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION A, LINE 6</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE ORGANIZATION HAS APPROXIMATELY 2,270 MEMBERS.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION A, LINE 7A</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE ORGANIZATION IS ELECTED ANNUALLY BY THE MEMBERS.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION A, LINE 7B</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>DECISIONS OF THE GOVERNING BODY ARE SUBJECT TO MAJORITY APPROVAL BY ITS MEMBERS.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION B, LINE 11B</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE TREASURER PRESENTS AND DISCUSSES A DRAFT COPY OF THE FORM 990 AT A REGULARLY SCHEDULED EXECUTIVE COMMITTEE MEETING. AFTER THOROUGH DISCUSSION OF THE CONTENT, THE TREASURER PREPARES APPROPRIATE REVISIONS AND THE FINAL DRAFT IS APPROVED BY A MAJORITY VOTE OF THE EXECUTIVE COMMITTEE.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION B, LINE 15A</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE PROCESS FOR DETERMINING COMPENSATION OF THE ORGANIZATIONS TOP MANAGEMENT OFFICIAL (GENERAL MANAGER) INCLUDED A REVIEW AND APPROVAL BY THE BOARD, ALL OF WHOM WERE INDEPENDENT.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION C, LINE 19</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE ORGANIZATION MAKES ITS CLUB RULES AND TAX RETURNS AVAILABLE TO THE PUBLIC AND MEMBERSHIP UPON REQUEST.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART XII, LINE 2C:</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE ORGANIZATION DOES HAVE A COMMITTEE THAT ASSUMES RESPONSIBILITY FOR OVERSIGHT OF THE AUDIT OF ITS FINANCIAL STATEMENTS AND SELECTION OF AN INDEPENDENT ACCOUNTANT. DURING THE CURRENT FISCAL YEAR, THE ORGANIZATION DID NOT CHANGE ITS OVERSIGHT OR SELECTION PROCESS.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
